WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.024
While Mole shivered in the Wild Wood, Rat dozed.

2
00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:11.045
Suddenly the fire crackled loudly.

3
00:00:11.046 --> 00:00:13.630
Rat woke with a start.

4
00:00:13.631 --> 00:00:17.433
The house was quiet.

5
00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:20.890
"Mole! Moly!" Rat shouted.

6
00:00:20.891 --> 00:00:23.056
He got up.

7
00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:26.024
"Mole's hat is gone," he said.

8
00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:29.554
"Mole's boots are not by the door.

9
00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:34.793
I bet he's gone to the Wild Wood," Rat said.

10
00:00:34.794 --> 00:00:37.552
Rat put on his coat.

11
00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:42.137
He grabbed the biggest club from his closet.

12
00:00:42.138 --> 00:00:47.220
"I hope Mole is safe," Rat said to himself.

13
00:00:47.221 --> 00:00:50.692
Rat set out for the Wild Wood.

14
00:00:50.693 --> 00:00:56.282
Inside the gloomy forest, wicked faces appeared.

15
00:00:56.283 --> 00:01:02.758
But they disappeared when they saw Rat's club.

16
00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:09.538
"Moly, Moly, Moly! Where are you!

17
00:01:09.539 --> 00:01:13.860
It's me. It's old Rat!" Rat called out.

18
00:01:13.861 --> 00:01:18.692
Rat searched every trail in the woods.

19
00:01:18.693 --> 00:01:22.290
"Mole must have left the path," he said.

20
00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:27.051
"Well, that means I will too."

21
00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:30.978
Rat stepped off the path.

22
00:01:30.979 --> 00:01:33.709
Rat looked behind rocks.

23
00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:37.069
He looked under piles of leaves.

24
00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:42.503
Then he heard a faint, scared voice.

25
00:01:42.504 --> 00:01:45.817
"Ratty?" the voice said.

26
00:01:45.818 --> 00:01:49.579
"Is that really you?"

27
00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:54.818
Rat turned. Ahead was a hollow tree.

28
00:01:54.819 --> 00:01:59.514
Rat went carefully to the tree and crept inside.

29
00:01:59.515 --> 00:02:05.921
There was poor Mole, shaking with fear.

